    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact trailing-edge (Triac) dimmer for 100-240V dimmable LED lamps: LED up to 200W (1A), resistive loads up to 300W. Dim with the wireless switches or a wired push switch.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePart of the iKinetic RF433 wireless lighting control system: pair the receiver with iKinetic kinetic (battery-free) wall switches such as IK01 and place the switch anywhere - no new wiring needed. Encrypted RF transmission, memory for up to 10 switches per receiver, settings kept after a power cut.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eiKinetic AR25 RF433 Triac Dimmer 230V - Trailing Edge - LED max. 200W - Built-in\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact trailing-edge (Triac) dimmer for 100-240V dimmable LED lamps: LED up to 200W (1A), resistive loads up to 300W. Dim with the wireless switches or a wired push switch.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePart of the iKinetic RF433 wireless lighting control system: pair the receiver with iKinetic kinetic (battery-free) wall switches such as IK01 and place the switch anywhere - no new wiring needed. Encrypted RF transmission, memory for up to 10 switches per receiver, settings kept after a power cut.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eTechnical data\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eType\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTriac dimmer, trailing edge\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eChannels\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e1\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eInput voltage\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e100-240V AC, 50/60Hz\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput voltage\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e100-240V AC\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput current\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMax. 1A\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eLoad\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eLED max. 200W @ 230V; resistive max. 300W (2A)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRadio frequency\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRF433MHz\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWall switch\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePush switch (S1 / Sx)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTerminals\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eScrew-free, 0.4-2.5mm²\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eProtection\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eIP20\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWorking temperature\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTa -20 ~ +40ºC (Tc 85ºC)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDimensions\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e44.3 x 49.9 x 20.6mm\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWarranty\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e5 years\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis is the RF433-only version. Install at least 20 cm away from metal surfaces and strong electromagnetic sources; switch off the power before wiring. Switches are sold separately.\u003c/p\u003e",
